o-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Example raised power: I(5)</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-25/24\u00b7D/M\u2074+35/96\u00b7D\u00b2/M\u2074-5/96\u00b7D\u00b3/M\u2074+1/384\u00b7D\u2074/M\u2074+1/M\u2074<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7ctI<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Expanded one-loop bubble through finite order</strong>, used inside the counterterm insertions:</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">4/3\u00b7s\u00b7Lm\u00b7g<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>4/3\u00b7s\u00b7L4pi\u00b7g<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>4/3\u00b7s\u00b7g<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>2/3\u00b7s\u00b7g<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>4\u00b7M\u00b7Lm\u00b7g<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>4\u00b7M\u00b7L4pi\u00b7g<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>4\u00b7M\u00b7g<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>4/3\u00b7Lm\u00b7P<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b7P<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>4/3\u00b7L4pi\u00b7P<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b7P<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>4/3\u00b7P<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,mu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b7P<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>D,nu<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>/eps</div></div></div></marimo-tabs></marimo-ui-element>"
